{"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents"]]},"variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/oudscomponents\/actions"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}]}],"kind":"article","abstract":[{"text":"Some components can be used for ","type":"text"},{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"text":"actions","type":"text"}]},{"text":".","type":"text"}],"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents\/Actions","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"schemaVersion":{"minor":3,"patch":0,"major":0},"primaryContentSections":[{"content":[{"text":"Overview","level":2,"anchor":"Overview","type":"heading"},{"text":"Buttons","level":3,"anchor":"Buttons","type":"heading"},{"tabs":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"identifier":"component_button_Orange","type":"image"}]}],"title":"Orange"},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"identifier":"component_button_OrangeCompact","type":"image"}]}],"title":"Orange Compact"},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"identifier":"component_button_Sosh","type":"image"}]}],"title":"Sosh"},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"identifier":"component_button_Wireframe","type":"image"}]}],"title":"Wireframe"}],"type":"tabNavigator"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"The ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents\/OUDSButton","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":" proposes layout with text only, icon only or text and icon.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"Four hierarchies are proposed for all layouts: ","type":"text"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"default","type":"text"}],"type":"emphasis"},{"text":", ","type":"text"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"strong","type":"text"}],"type":"emphasis"},{"text":", ","type":"text"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"minimal","type":"text"}],"type":"emphasis"},{"text":" and ","type":"text"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"negative","type":"text"}],"type":"emphasis"},{"text":".","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"Two style are available: ","type":"text"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"default"}],"type":"emphasis"},{"text":" and ","type":"text"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"loading","type":"text"}],"type":"emphasis"},{"text":".","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"If button is placed on colored surface using ","type":"text"},{"code":"OUDSColoredSurface","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":", the default colors (content, background and border) are automatically adjusted to switch to monochrom.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"A button with ","type":"text"},{"code":"OUDSButton.Appearance.Negative","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" appearance is not allowed as a direct or indirect child of an ","type":"text"},{"code":"OUDSColoredSurface","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":".","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"Two sizes are available: ","type":"text"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"default","type":"text"}],"type":"emphasis"},{"text":" and ","type":"text"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"small","type":"text"}],"type":"emphasis"},{"text":".","type":"text"}]},{"type":"codeListing","code":["    \/\/ Icon only with default appearance","    OUDSButton(image: OUDSImage(asset: Image(\"ic_heart\")), accessibilityLabel: \"Like\", appearance: .default) { \/* the action to process *\/ }","","    \/\/ Text only with negative appearance","    OUDSButton(text: \"Delete\", appearance: .negative, size: .small) {}","    ","    \/\/ The same button (text only) with loading style (indeterminate process)","    OUDSButton(text: \"Delete\", style: .loading(), size: .small) {}","    ","    \/\/ The same button (text only) with loading style (progress at 75 %)","    OUDSButton(text: \"Delete\", style: .loading(progress: 0.75), size: .small) {}"],"syntax":"swift"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"For accessibility reasons, if the user in the system settings toggles the option to reduce the animations, the loading indicator will be frozen to be more comfortable for the user.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"For ecodesign reasons, if the user toggles the low power mode, the loading indicator will be frozen to prevent the CPU to work and waste energy.","type":"text"}]}],"kind":"content"}],"sections":[],"metadata":{"images":[{"identifier":"ic_folder_categories.png","type":"icon"},{"identifier":"ic_folder_categories.png","type":"card"}],"modules":[{"name":"Components"}],"roleHeading":"Article","role":"article","title":"Actions"},"references":{"doc://OUDSComponents/documentation/OUDSComponents/OUDSButton":{"title":"OUDSButton","url":"\/documentation\/oudscomponents\/oudsbutton","identifier":"doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents\/OUDSButton","type":"topic","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Button is a UI element that triggers an action or event, and is used to initiate tasks or confirming an action."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Button appears in different layouts, styles and states to indicate hierarchy or emphasis."}],"fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"struct"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"OUDSButton"}],"role":"symbol","kind":"symbol","navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"OUDSButton"}]},"component_button_Orange":{"variants":[{"traits":["1x","light"],"url":"\/images\/OUDSComponents\/component_button_Orange.png"}],"alt":"A button component in light and dark modes with Orange theme","type":"image","identifier":"component_button_Orange"},"component_button_OrangeCompact":{"type":"image","identifier":"component_button_OrangeCompact","alt":"A button component in light and dark modes with Orange Compact theme","variants":[{"url":"\/images\/OUDSComponents\/component_button_OrangeCompact.png","traits":["1x","light"]}]},"ic_folder_categories.png":{"type":"image","identifier":"ic_folder_categories.png","alt":null,"variants":[{"url":"\/images\/OUDSComponents\/ic_folder_categories.png","traits":["1x","light"]}]},"doc://OUDSComponents/documentation/OUDSComponents":{"title":"Components","url":"\/documentation\/oudscomponents","identifier":"doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents","type":"topic","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"The catalog of all components provided by OUDS. It contains also "},{"code":"View","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" extensions and "},{"code":"ViewModifiers","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" to apply tokens and styles on components and higher-level views."}],"role":"collection","kind":"symbol","images":[{"type":"icon","identifier":"ic_folder_categories.png"}]},"component_button_Sosh":{"type":"image","identifier":"component_button_Sosh","variants":[{"url":"\/images\/OUDSComponents\/component_button_Sosh.png","traits":["1x","light"]}],"alt":"A button component in light and dark modes with Sosh theme"},"component_button_Wireframe":{"identifier":"component_button_Wireframe","alt":"A button component in light and dark modes with Wireframe theme","type":"image","variants":[{"url":"\/images\/OUDSComponents\/component_button_Wireframe.png","traits":["1x","light"]}]}}}